  {
   "rating": 3,
   "date": "2005-05-07T23:33:12-05:00",
   "body": "This might sound a bit silly, but I've been afraid of using my second \"R.O.I.D.S\" due to what he says. \"Be warned, while the immediate effect is a titanic burst of strength, the long term effects on your spirit and intelligence could be hazardous.\". Will consuming this/these item(s) indeed decrease my stats or not, on longterm ?\n\nEdited, Sat May  7 19:34:25 2005",
